{"title":"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf20588e37191208e5a3d465edd72b7fb086586f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> is tangent to that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d41924511e560cb312be35e2949c22b9cb00b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=\\sqrt{2m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/0/e500b32f10fe6462c21ec997c96c37432803abc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) m must equal } \\tfrac{1}{2}\\quad \\text{(B) m must equal  } \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\quad\\\\ \\text{(C) m must equal } \\sqrt{2}\\quad \\text{(D) m must equal } 2\\quad\\\\ \\text{(E) m may be any non-negative real number}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"324\" height=\"84\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the first equation represents a circle and the second equation represents a line.  If a line is tangent to a circle, then it only hits at one point, so there will only be one solution to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=System_of_equations\" title=\"System of equations\">system of equations</a>.\n</p><p>In the second equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5c9b7faabff491e8a36fa3d88b9c42cbef7daf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -x + \\sqrt{2m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />.  Substitution results in \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/98545a7fcc27b1b528c6f2eae6456f499abaaffa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 + x^2 - 2x\\sqrt{2m} + 2m = m\\]\" width=\"226\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfc8ae7e6732394a3956c424a8d7bc5317ca1ecb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2x^2 - 2x\\sqrt{2m} + m = 0\\]\" width=\"179\" height=\"18\" />\nIn order for the system to have one solution, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discriminant\" title=\"Discriminant\">discriminant</a> must equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f68a335464c06d887361e1bba2a73f035bee73b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4(2m) - 4 \\cdot 2 \\cdot m = 0\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811bb7773c79bdafc86360780f01eb98b793cb10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0 = 0\\]\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> can be a non-negative real number, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf20588e37191208e5a3d465edd72b7fb086586f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> has <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radius\" title=\"Radius\">radius</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c707f01031d7f0a1e7ec87f782a715b580482d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d41924511e560cb312be35e2949c22b9cb00b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=\\sqrt{2m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Diagonal\" title=\"Diagonal\">diagonal</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Plane\" title=\"Plane\">plane</a> with <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Slope\" title=\"Slope\">slope</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, if the two <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Curves\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Curves\">curves</a> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Tangent\" title=\"Tangent\">tangent</a> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d41924511e560cb312be35e2949c22b9cb00b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=\\sqrt{2m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" /> either has to pass through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337ef286ec0bf17da213b68a4dc92cad711a1be4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{\\sqrt{2m}}{2}, \\frac{\\sqrt{2m}}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"43\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/4/f9426df0e229b3ae13e486523758e6968f6c6a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2m}}{2}, -\\frac{\\sqrt{2m}}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"141\" height=\"43\" />. However, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/3/e03f0c3c016054c712f7a04afa8da66ed182b853.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{2m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"21\" /> is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Positive\">positive</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a> can only pass through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/337ef286ec0bf17da213b68a4dc92cad711a1be4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{\\sqrt{2m}}{2}, \\frac{\\sqrt{2m}}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"43\" />, which it does for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME\" title=\"1969 AHSME\">1969 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1969 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1969\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1969_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1969 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017165914\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 239/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 176/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4249/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.302      1 -total\n 61.46%    8.790      1 Template:AHSME_35p_box\n 36.18%    5.174      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13063:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017165914 and revision id 202903. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}